WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:04.698
A rattle starts somewhere in the body.
Three accelerometers on the panel.

2
00:00:05.018 --> 00:00:10.169
The wave reaches each one at a different
moment — A, then C, then B.

3
00:00:10.653 --> 00:00:14.533
You never need to know when it happened.
Only the differences.

4
00:00:15.061 --> 00:00:19.068
Each difference draws a curve
of every point that could have produced it.

5
00:00:19.528 --> 00:00:22.332
Two curves. One crossing.
That's your source.
